@startuml
title Resetting the current meal plan
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor User
participant MishMash
participant Parser
participant ResetPlanCommand as Reset
participant ActiveMealPlan as Active

User -> MishMash : reset-plan
MishMash -> Parser : parseCommand("reset-plan")
activate Parser
Parser -> Parser : validate no arguments
create Reset
Parser -> Reset : new ResetPlanCommand(activePlan)
Parser --> MishMash : reset command
deactivate Parser
note right of Reset
  Parsing keeps the shared holder;
  it does not change any state.
end note
MishMash -> Reset : execute(recipeBook)
activate Reset
Reset -> Active : get() / getGroceryList()
Active --> Reset : current presence of plan and groceries
Reset -> Active : clear()
note right of Active
  Clears plan, generation request,
  and grocery snapshot.
end note
Active --> Reset
Reset -> Reset : assert cleared state; log previous presence
alt plan or groceries were present
  Reset --> MishMash : reset confirmation
else no plan or groceries
  Reset --> MishMash : no active plan to reset
end
deactivate Reset
MishMash --> User : display result and next prompt
note over Reset, Active
  Recipes, dietary settings, and recorded meals
  are owned elsewhere and remain unchanged.
end note
@enduml
